    { question: 'How long does tile installation take?', answer: 'A kitchen backsplash typically takes 1-2 days. A bathroom floor takes 2-3 days including substrate prep and grouting. A full shower with wall and floor tile takes 5-7 days, including waterproofing, tile setting, grouting, and curing time. We provide a specific timeline for your project during the consultation.' },
  ]} />
